```

---

# ## One Important Note for Windows WSL2

# All your project files should live **inside WSL2 filesystem**, not on your Windows C drive. So your project path should look like:
# ```
# /home/yourusername/land-registry/
# ```

# Not:
# ```
# /mnt/c/Users/yourname/land-registry/